    "detailed_description": "What really makes Moon War Meta unique is definitely its incredible visual style and attention to detail.<br><br>You will notice right from the start that the game brings you in a very creative, exciting and realistic sci-fi world where you get to explore new worlds, complete all kinds of objectives and also collect incredible items, rarities that you just can\u2019t find anywhere else.<br><br>You can build your own city the way you like, and thanks to the Unity game design engine,\u200b Moon War Meta  looks amazing and even photorealistic.<br>On top of that, the decentralized metaverse world and the fact you have governance is what really sets Moon War Meta apart.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834950/extras/884c4214a2e6305a68ad08e6ad186b81.poster.avif?t=1719885825\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834950/extras/884c4214a2e6305a68ad08e6ad186b81.webm?t=1719885825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834950/extras/884c4214a2e6305a68ad08e6ad186b81.mp4?t=1719885825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Since Moon War Meta is an RPG at its core, you have multiple game modes to check out.<br>You have Player versus Player, Player versus World, Ranked gameplay, but also Team vs Team and Teams War.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834950/extras/144acdd385830784b6dccb4d1041ef93.poster.avif?t=1719885825\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834950/extras/144acdd385830784b6dccb4d1041ef93.webm?t=1719885825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834950/extras/144acdd385830784b6dccb4d1041ef93.mp4?t=1719885825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to the Spacecraft Customization Center in Moon War Meta, part of our exclusive Kickstarter Founder's Pack! <br><br>Craft your own unique spacecraft from scratch or modify existing models to suit your playstyle and strategy. With a vast array of components, weapons, and enhancements at your disposal, the possibilities are limitless. Whether you prefer agile interceptors, heavily armored cruisers, or versatile jack-of-all-trades vessels, the choice is yours. Take command, unleash your creativity, and dominate the skies like never before in Moon War Meta!",
