kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834950/extras/144acdd385830784b6dccb4d1041ef93.mp4?t=1719885825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to the Spacecraft Customization Center in Moon War Meta, part of our exclusive Kickstarter Founder's Pack! <br><br>Craft your own unique spacecraft from scratch or modify existing models to suit your playstyle and strategy. With a vast array of components, weapons, and enhancements at your disposal, the possibilities are limitless. Whether you prefer agile interceptors, heavily armored cruisers, or versatile jack-of-all-trades vessels, the choice is yours. Take command, unleash your creativity, and dominate the skies like never before in Moon War Meta!",
